WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.470
Two portraits,

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.730
two print orders.

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:04.890
Still lining up every copy by hand?

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:07.600
First visit?

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:09.200
Wiwo shows you around.

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:10.680
Copy an example package or

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:11.520
make your own with the

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:13.360
sizes and prices you sell

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:20.040
Bring the first portrait

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:21.180
into Pixmora.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:22.480
Frame the face,

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:23.600
remove the background,

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:24.800
and choose white.

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:31.790
There's your first set of four

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:34.660
Now add the Pixmora dragon.

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:36.020
Pick its package,

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:37.960
zoom in to check every edge,

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:41.000
and add a sheet whenever

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:41.920
you need one

00:00:44.117 --> 00:00:45.677
Pixmora places the copies

00:00:45.677 --> 00:00:46.737
on the page.

00:00:46.777 --> 00:00:47.797
Four portraits,

00:00:47.797 --> 00:00:49.017
eight dragons.

00:00:49.077 --> 00:00:50.137
Check the layout,

00:00:50.137 --> 00:00:51.097
then export the whole

00:00:51.097 --> 00:00:52.557
sheet as a PDF

00:00:53.567 --> 00:00:55.237
Your next print order starts here.

00:00:55.467 --> 00:00:56.997
Open Pixmora Studio

